$N=4$, $A = [5, 0, 9, 3]$.
Initially (Year 0): $C = [5, 0, 9, 3]$.
After 1 year (Year 1):
Alien 1 becomes adult.
Adults before year 1: None.
So Alien 1 receives 0 stones.
