This looks like a simulation. However, $N$ is up to $2 \times 10^5$ and $Q$ is up to $3 \times 10^5$. A direct simulation for each query would take $O(N)$ per query, leading to $O(NQ)$ total time, which is too slow ($6 \times 10^{10}$ operations). We need a more efficient approach.

